  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why this matters",
      "char_file": "미세먼지_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Skin, eyes, and airways —",
        "these three take the hit",
        "",
        "Fine particles are small enough",
        "to get deep into all three,",
        "not just your lungs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Skin",
      "char_file": "미세먼지_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "PM2.5 is small enough to",
        "settle into your pores",
        "",
        "That triggers oxidative stress,",
        "which breaks down the",
        "collagen that keeps skin firm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "For skin, try this",
      "char_file": "물방울_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Cleanse thoroughly after",
        "you've been outside",
        "",
        "Follow with a vitamin C",
        "serum and moisturizer to",
        "support your skin's defenses"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Eyes",
      "char_file": "미세먼지_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Second, fine particles",
        "irritate the eyelid glands",
        "",
        "that keep your tear film stable —",
        "so it breaks down faster,",
        "leaving eyes dry and gritty"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "For eyes, try this",
      "char_file": "인공눈물_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Wear wraparound sunglasses",
        "on bad air days",
        "",
        "If your eyes feel irritated,",
        "rinse with artificial tears",
        "to clear out particles"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Airways",
      "char_file": "미세먼지_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Finally, particles under",
        "2.5 micrometers reach",
        "",
        "deep into your airways,",
        "triggering inflammation —",
        "coughing and tight breathing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "For airways, try this",
      "char_file": "마스크_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Wear a well-fitted N95",
        "mask on high pollution days",
        "",
        "and rinse your throat with",
        "water once you're back inside"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "None of this means",
        "staying inside forever"
      ],
      [
        "A few habits go a long way",
        "on the days that matter"
